; pq-A-agree-01 - expression matrix, AmiBlitz3 case of
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/pq-A-agree-01.bas: 56 of its 56 cells
; pq-A-agree-01.expect: the output of blitz2-ab3 -r in AB3 mode (the
; port's compiler with AmiBlitz3's libraries)
